        <activityName xml:lang="en">Tyre wear emissions, passenger car</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Tyre wear emissions, passenger car
Calculation of non-exhaust emissions (tyre, brake and road wear emissions as well as petrol evaporation emissions) are based on: Ntziachristos, L., Boulter, P. (2009b). EMEP/EEA air pollutant emissions inventory guidebook 2009: Road vehicle tyre and brake wear;
UUID: b0b635cf-368a-3b82-adbb-2fa21da7f802
The activity starts with the abrasion of passenger car tyres on the road. The activity ends with emissions of passenger car tyre wear.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Unspecified
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 595466400 kg
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b0b635cf-368a-3b82-adbb-2fa21da7f802.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
